{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Throne Tides&quot; is a Multiplayer, Auto Chess, Real Time Strategy, Deck Building card game. It provides unique gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must craft your deck with care, selecting from powerful cards that represent creatures, spells, and special abilities. Place your cards strategically on the terrain in order to dominate lanes and ultimately conquer the enemy king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Building</strong>\u00a0- You will be able to build powerful decks combining champions with different Rarity, Synergy and Spells.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/2f0ae5cda2f4601074d067f76141b4a2.poster.avif?t=1750271900\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/2f0ae5cda2f4601074d067f76141b4a2.webm?t=1750271900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/2f0ae5cda2f4601074d067f76141b4a2.mp4?t=1750271900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Intense Battles</strong> - Challenge players in intense PvP battles, or test your skills in the engaging single-player campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/839a5dd34079bdc2d80cf2d24de32c47.poster.avif?t=1750271900\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/839a5dd34079bdc2d80cf2d24de32c47.webm?t=1750271900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/839a5dd34079bdc2d80cf2d24de32c47.mp4?t=1750271900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Objective Control</strong> - Take control of key points on the map, such as magical fountains that grant additional income, to gain a strategic advantage over your enemies. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Augments System</strong> - Every 10 minutes, choose from a selection of three augments to enhance your capabilities and adapt to the evolving battlefield. These augments provide crucial bonuses that can turn the tide of battle in your favor. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strategic Placement</strong> - Carefully position your creatures on the terrain to maximize their effectiveness and counter your opponent\u2019s strategies. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/1e5f225ff2c3cf101825694bc93b0297.poster.avif?t=1750271900\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/1e5f225ff2c3cf101825694bc93b0297.webm?t=1750271900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/1e5f225ff2c3cf101825694bc93b0297.mp4?t=1750271900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Unique Card Mechanics</strong> - Utilize a variety of cards, each with unique abilities and synergies, to outsmart and outmaneuver your opponent. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>King Upgrades</strong> - Upgrade your king's damage, health, and income wisely in order to to strengthen your position and dominate the battlefield.<br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/318b0f580674a7908353e4f62ed6fbb5.poster.avif?t=1750271900\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/318b0f580674a7908353e4f62ed6fbb5.webm?t=1750271900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/318b0f580674a7908353e4f62ed6fbb5.mp4?t=1750271900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/extras/d9d64b8ca9f7d322f912001b64726cd1.avif?t=1750271900\" width=600 height=183 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2870940?t=1750271900","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750271900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/7afccc067d86a8eda9220c9b2ea115231f75fc04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750271900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870940/7afccc067d86a8eda9220c9b2ea115231f75fc04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750271900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_p